{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/store_wishlist.gif?t=1745790120\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Townseek</i> is a relaxing exploration-trading game where you take to the skies and explore the world of <i>Explora</i> discovering the lost legacy of <i>Sir Reginald Sharkingston</i>! Travel far and wide, discover exotic landmarks, visit faraway towns, trade with whimsical characters, catch fish, discover artefacts, and so much more! <strong>The whole world is your sea now, so be sure to see all that it has to offer!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/store_introduction.gif?t=1745790120\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DISCOVER A PICTURESQUE WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a gorgeous hand-drawn world at your own pace! Uncover unique locations, spawning lush forests, freezing icebergs, vast deserts, striking volcanoes, and beyond!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/store_exploration_banner.gif?t=1745790120\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TRADE WITH UNIQUE TOWNS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trade with town hosts for unique items and profit! Complete quests for them to improve your reputation and unlock upgrades and cosmetics. Discover diverse cultures of sharkfolk, cats, slimes, stonelings, regular humans, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/store_trading_banner.gif?t=1745790120\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MAKE IT YOUR JOURNEY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are tons of things to do all over <i>Explora</i>! Need a break from trading? Obtain new blimps and hulls to customise your airship. Buy a fishing rod and go catch peculiar fish. Mine one-of-a-kind artefacts. Dig for treasure. Farm for exotic fruits. Make the journey your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/store_fishing_banner.gif?t=1745790120\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">COMPLETE YOUR JOURNAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reassemble the journal bestowed upon you by <i>Captain Jawline</i> and discover the lost legacy of <i>Sir Reginald Sharkingston</i>! Fill it with memories of your own travels, strive to complete your item collection, and make this a truly unforgettable adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/store_collection_banner.gif?t=1745790120\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1659360?t=1745790120","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745790120","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745790120","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745790120","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/ext